        "official_en_sha256": "a46225aa45f14ace565fda82152f6977abfb62820f60edaff5550a3c40d4490b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おや……。\r\nレインさんは石板のカケラをすでに持っているようですね。",
        "official_en": "Ah, Sir Rain, it doth seem thou art already in possession of a tablet shard...or mayhap more?",
        "real_en": "Oh... It seems you already have a tablet fragment, Rain-san."
