      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このカケラを見ていると、妙に頭がざわざわするのです。\r\nきっと、わたくしの記憶と関係しているのでしょう。",
        "official_en": "When I cast mine eyes upon this shard, my thoughts grow clouded with unease. I know not why, but perhaps it stirs my memories.",
        "real_en": "When I look at this fragment, I feel strangely unsettled. I'm sure it has something to do with my memories."
      },
