        "official_en_sha256": "f6d155c9f2838b98c431852d31a560b584a8d9a5673d30c7c5b5e02086a2ebd5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ですが、この石板のカケラは、どこに何個あるのかわかりません。\r\nこの世界のあちこちに散らばっているようです。",
        "official_en": "And yet, I know not how many fragments there be in all. ’Twould seem they lie scattered across the world.",
        "real_en": "But I don't know how many tablet fragments there are or where to find them. They seem to be scattered all over the world."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
