        "official_en_sha256": "139ae50480e2adc571ef490ebddc2cfce30a9919ab2981dba3331c24007dec44"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、この形……。\r\nただの石っていうより、石板のカケラのような……。",
        "official_en": "But based on the shape... It looks more like a fragment of a larger tablet than just an ordinary stone.",
        "real_en": null
