        "official_en_sha256": "933f4348cc4ac7d1f2e3377ecad90dd785a8d07ca7df22f412565531a32eab93"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "わたくしが姫だということは覚えているのですが……。\r\nそれ以外のことが全く思い出せません。",
        "official_en": "I know only that I am a princess...and nothing more.",
        "real_en": "I remember that I'm a princess, but I can't remember anything else..."
