        "official_en_sha256": "1fdb25d592d8de185d9212fa01f958de08310f24039f86d93da7fbfd326002ab"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "カケラを集めて、元の石板に戻せたら、\r\nわたくしがどこの国の姫なのかも思い出せそうな気がします。",
        "official_en": "If the shards be gathered and the tablet made whole once more, mayhap then shall I recall more of my origin.",
        "real_en": "If we collect the pieces and put the tablet back together, I feel like I might remember which country I'm from."
